#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:866 C/gnumeric.xml:1123
msgid "Changing the list of bookmark folders."
msgstr "Ändra listan med bokmärkesmappar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:870
msgid ""
"The list of starting folders shown in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> of <xref linkend=\"fig-file-open-dialog-"
"components\"/> may contain starting folders selected by the user. These "
"folders are called 'bookmark folders' and are listed in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> below a thin horizontal separator line. For "
"example, <xref linkend=\"fig-file-open-dialog-components\"/> contains a "
"folder named <filename>currentWork</filename> which is a bookmark folder "
"selected by the user."
msgstr ""
"I område <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> i <xref linkend=\"fig-file-"
"open-dialog-components\"/> kan listan innehålla startmappar som användaren "
"själv har valt. De kallas bokmärkesmappar och visas under en tunn vågrät "
"avdelare i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>. I <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-file-open-dialog-components\"/> är mappen "
"<filename>currentWork</filename> ett bokmärke som användaren har lagt till."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:883
msgid ""
"These bookmark folders can be added in two ways. A folder which is selected "
"in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> can be added as a bookmark by "
"clicking on the <guibutton>Add</guibutton> button in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">E</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan lägga till bokmärkesmappar på två sätt. Om en mapp är markerad i "
"område <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> klickar du på knappen "
"<guibutton>Lägg till</guibutton> i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">E</emphasis>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:891
msgid ""
"Alternatively, the folder can be dragged from area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> into area <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>. "
"The folder can be dragged by placing the mouse pointer over the folder name "
"in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>, clicking and holding the "
"primary mouse button, moving the mouse pointer to area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> and releasing the mouse button. As the mouse "
"pointer is moved from area <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> to area "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>, a small icon of the folder will move "
"with the mouse pointer."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också dra mappen från område <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> "
"till område <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>. Håll pekaren över namnet "
"på mappen i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>, håll ned primär "
"musknapp, flytta pekaren till område <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> "
"och släpp knappen. En liten ikon av mappen följer med pekaren när du drar "
"den från område <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> till område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:905
msgid ""
"Any bookmark folder can also be removed from the list of starting folders "
"presented in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>. A bookmark folder "
"can be removed by clicking on the folder name in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> and then clicking on the "
"<guibutton>Remove</guibutton> in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">E</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också ta bort en bokmärkesmapp från listan över startmappar i område "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>. Markera mappen i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> och klicka sedan på <guibutton>Ta "
"bort</guibutton> i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">E</emphasis>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:931
msgid "The file formats which Gnumeric can read."
msgstr "Filformat som Gnumeric kan läsa."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:933
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can open files which have been created "
"in several formats by other spreadsheet programs or databases. The details "
"of these formats are provided in <xref linkend=\"sect-file-formats\"/> and "
"the name of each file type in the table below skips to the appropriate "
"section of <xref linkend=\"sect-file-formats\"/>. The opening of text "
"formatted files is described in <xref linkend=\"sect-file-textImport\"/>. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can also import text data or HTML and "
"XHTML tables through the clipboard mechanism, as is explained in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-movecopy-xclipboard\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan öppna filer i flera format som "
"skapats av andra kalkylprogram eller databaser. Mer information finns i "
"<xref linkend=\"sect-file-formats\"/>. Namnen på filformaten i tabellen "
"nedan länkar till respektive avsnitt i <xref linkend=\"sect-file-"
"formats\"/>. I <xref linkend=\"sect-file-textImport\"/> beskrivs hur du "
"öppnar textfiler. <application>Gnumeric</application> kan också importera "
"textdata och tabeller i formaten HTML och XHTML via urklippet, enligt <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-movecopy-xclipboard\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:949
msgid ""
"Most of these formats are provided by plugins, which are independent, "
"configurable modules. If a format described below does not appear in the "
"<interface>File Open</interface> dialog, this may be because the appropriate"
" plugin has not been configured or started. This can be verified by "
"examining the list of plugins which are currently running in the "
"<interface>Plugin Manager</interface> dialog."
msgstr ""
"De flesta av formaten tillhandahålls av insticksmoduler, fristående moduler "
"som kan konfigureras. Om ett format som beskrivs nedan inte finns i "
"dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface> kan det bero på att "
"insticksmodulen inte har konfigurerats eller startats. Kontrollera listan "
"över aktiva insticksmoduler i dialogrutan "
"<interface>Insticksmodulhanteraren</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:959 C/gnumeric.xml:1218
msgid ""
"The <interface>Plugin Manager</interface> dialog lists the plugins which are"
" currently in use and provides a way to start plugins which are currently "
"disabled. The <interface>Plugin Manager</interface> can be started by "
"selecting, in the <guimenu>Tools</guimenu> menu, the <guimenuitem>Plug-"
"ins...</guimenuitem> menu item; see <xref linkend=\"sect-configuration-"
"plugins\"/> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Dialogrutan <interface>Insticksmodulhanteraren</interface> visar vilka "
"insticksmoduler som används och låter dig starta moduler som är "
"inaktiverade. Öppna <interface>Insticksmodulhanteraren</interface> via menyn"
" <guimenu>Verktyg</guimenu> genom att välja "
"<guimenuitem>Insticksmoduler…</guimenuitem>. Mer information finns i <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-configuration-plugins\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:973
msgid "The file formats which <application>Gnumeric</application> can open."
msgstr "Filformat som <application>Gnumeric</application> kan öppna."
